      "id": "FAQ-04",
      "question": "What is REAP and who conducts it?",
      "shortAnswer": "REAP (Rajasthan Engineering Admission Process) is the state's centralised, no-separate-entrance-exam counselling process for B.E./B.Tech/B.Arch seats, conducted by the Centre for Electronic Governance (CEG) under the Dept. of Technical Education.",
      "detail": "Merit comes from JEE Main rank, Class 12 percentile, or diploma percentile depending on the eligibility route used.",
      "sourceSheet": "06_Admissions_Rules; 17_Glossary",
      "sourceStatus": "SECONDARY",
      "caveat": "—"
